/P 223 0 R
/E (The Library and Borrow Book Tracking System is a computerized solution designed to manage library books and borrowing activities efficiently. It replaces traditional manual record-keeping with a digital database that allows librarians to track available, borrowed, and returned books accurately. The system helps reduce errors, save time, and improve overall library efficiency by supporting book management, user management, and borrow/return tracking. It is designed for small to medium-sized libraries such as school or college libraries.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
